# ===========================
# Project-specific
# ===========================
# 루트의 _archive 만 무시한다. scripts/stage0/_archive 처럼 코드를 옮겨 둔 곳은
# 추적해야 하므로 앞에 / 를 붙여 깊이를 고정한다.
/_archive/
# 데이터 본체는 올리지 않되, 데이터셋 카드(.md)는 올린다.
# 폴더를 통째로 제외하면 하위 예외가 안 먹으므로 data/** 로 쓰고 디렉터리를 되살린다.
# 주의: "data/" 는 모든 깊이의 data 폴더를 잡았지만 "data/**" 는 루트 기준만 잡는다.
# 그래서 아래 깊은 data 폴더는 따로 막는다(_docs/experiments/data 는 문서라 제외 안 함).
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/*.md
# Evaluation dataset metadata/GT are small, reviewable source-of-truth
# artifacts.  Keep RGB, review overlays, video, and other binary payloads
# ignored by ``data/**`` while allowing these exact text contracts into Git.
!data/evaluation/**/README.md
!data/evaluation/**/DATASET_CONTRACT.json
!data/evaluation/**/DATASET_TARGETS.json
!data/evaluation/**/ACQUISITION_DOMAIN_MAP.json
!data/evaluation/**/objects/*.json
!data/evaluation/**/manifests/*.csv
!data/evaluation/**/manifests/*.json
!data/evaluation/**/reports/*.md
!data/evaluation/**/reports/*.csv
!data/evaluation/**/session.json
!data/evaluation/**/frame_tags.csv
!data/evaluation/**/annotations/**/*.json
# Paper track contracts.  These are small reviewable JSON/CSV provenance
# artifacts (population locks, evaluator contracts, adaptation pool membership).
# Heavy per-frame dumps live in subdirectories and stay ignored by ``data/**``.
!data/pallet/results/paper_eval_v1/*.json
!data/pallet/results/paper_eval_v1/*.md
!data/evaluation/**/adaptation/*.csv
!data/evaluation/**/adaptation/*.json
!data/pallet/results/paper_selftrain_v1/*.json
!data/pallet/results/paper_selftrain_v1/*.md
!data/pallet/results/paper_selftrain_v1/**/*.json
challenge/pallet_jetson_deploy/data/
# 체크포인트는 올리지 않되 정리 사유(README)는 남긴다 — data/ 와 같은 방식.
weights/**
!weights/**/
!weights/**/*.md
debug/
logs/
demo_data/
foundationpose/
exp/
wandb/
sacred/
artifacts/
output/
run_used.yml

# Large data / recordings / model weights (no images in repo)
challenge/data/**
!challenge/data/**/
!challenge/data/**/*.md
# The canonical GT-v2 dataset path is a tracked relative symlink.  Its target
# remains the single authoritative tree under challenge/real_gt_v2/migrated_gt.
!challenge/data/01_real/gt_v2_canonical
challenge/weights/
challenge/model/*
!challenge/model/README.md
depth_cam/rec/
depth_cam/runs/

# 25y_automatic_lifter-master 의 학습 결과 / 녹화 / 캐시
25y_automatic_lifter-master/**/runs/
25y_automatic_lifter-master/**/rec/
25y_automatic_lifter-master/**/__pycache__/

# Playwright 자동화 출력 (스크린샷 / console log)
.playwright-mcp/

